# Environment Variables (Canonical)

Use these exact names (do not invent alternatives):
- SOLANA_NODE_RPC_ENDPOINT  (HTTP)
- SOLANA_NODE_WSS_ENDPOINT  (WS)
- GEYSER_ENDPOINT           (optional)
- GEYSER_API_TOKEN          (optional)
- GEYSER_AUTH_TYPE          (optional)
- SOLANA_PRIVATE_KEY        (Base58 string; only needed for live)

Dry-run & control flags we add:
- DRY_RUN                   (bool, default true in examples)
- DRY_RUN_STARTING_SOL      (float, e.g., 3.0)
- DRY_RUN_VALUE_MODE        (entry|quote|rpc; default entry)
- HALT                      (0/1)

Notes:
- Always quote URL values in `.env` (e.g., `"...?api-key=XXXX"`).
